# Uploads Directory

This directory stores temporary video files during upload processing.

- Files are automatically cleaned up after successful upload to YouTube
- Maximum file size: 2GB
- Supported formats: mp4, mpeg, mov, avi, wmv, webm, 3gp, flv, mkv
- Files older than 24 hours should be manually cleaned if needed

## Security Note

This directory should not be publicly accessible and files should not be served directly.
All uploaded files are temporary and are deleted after processing.
